paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003eFEATURING:- Gorgeous HD Space graphics\u003cbr/\u003e- 7 STUNNING WORLDS\u003cbr/\u003e- An Amazing Electronic Soundtrack\u003cbr/\u003e- REAL Vocals from NASA\u0026#39;S amazing Journey in SPACE [THANK YOU NASA]\u003cbr/\u003e- Unique Spherical Game-play unlike any other game ever made!\u003cbr/\u003e- Calculate the correct Orbital Trajectory\u003cbr/\u003e- Change the COLOR of the LASERS by pressing on your ship\u003cbr/\u003e- Feel like you are FLYING through SPACE with gorgeous graphics\u003cbr/\u003e- TOP 10 Most downloaded Demo on the PlayStation store, since it\u0026#39;s release!Play the only SPACE Shooter game of it\u0026#39;s kind! GAME PLAY INSTRUCTIONS:\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e- SWIPE - UP - DOWN - LEFT - RIGHT [FLIGHT MOVEMENT]\u003cbr/\u003e- Add an additional SWIPE in the direction you are heading in to activate \u0026#34;HYPER DRIVE\u0026#34;\u003cbr/\u003e- Hold TOUCH on the Screen to SHOOT\u003cbr/\u003e- Change LASER COLORS by Tapping on your SHIP\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e- You mush shoot down all the AI traveling around the world, using the correct \u0026#34;COLOR LASER\u0026#34;\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e- Each one leaves behind a TRAIL which will help you \u0026#34;CALCULATE IT\u0026#39;S ORBITAL TRAJECTORY\u0026#34; - Each level will get HARDER"},"developer_note":{"text":""},"tags":[{"id":796630,"value":"Action","uri":"tapglobal://taptap.tw/library?tag=Action","web_url":"/tag/action"},{"id":796631,"value":"Strategy","uri":"tapglobal://taptap.tw/library?tag=Strategy","web_url":"/tag/strategy"}],"log":{"follow":{"uri":"https://tap-snow-hk.log-global.aliyuncs.com/logstores/logs/track.gif","params":{"type":"follow","APIVersion":"0.6.0","paramId":33696054,"paramType":"appDetail"}},"open":{"uri":